# The standard controls by label, as `ceangal test` runs them on the web
# and natively (docs/guide/testing.md).
see "status: ready"
tap "Save"
see "status: saved"
tap "Subscribe to updates"
see "status: subscribed on"
tap "Large"
see "status: size 2"
key Up
see "status: size 1"
tap "Name"
type "Ada"
see "Hello, Ada"
tap "Delete"
see "Delete everything?"
tap "Keep"
see "status: kept"
not "Delete everything?"
tap "Lists"
tap "Inbox, 3 new"
see "status: inbox"
